Description: Implements the binomial and Fisher's (2x2 and 2x3 so far) exact
    tests, along with corresponding discrete distributions
    (binomial, hypergeometric).  Accuracy of these functions compares favorably
    to their counterparts in the R 4.6 standard library; exact-test functions
    are also much faster.
